coverage

# The env file .env.example tells you to create. Ignored HERE and not only in the monorepo root:
# `frontend/` is split to the root of a separate repository (gitverse slide_frontend), where the
# root .gitignore does not travel and this file is the only one there is — so an entry that exists
# only upstairs protects one of the two repository shapes. `*.local` above covers `.env.local` and
# nothing else.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

